<!-- Header panel -->
<div class="panel">
  <div class="topline">
    <h1>📊 {{ t('Intraday Flow Tracker', '盘中资金流追踪') }}</h1>
    <span class="lag-tag">{{ t('≈15-min delayed bars', '≈15分钟延迟价格') }}</span>
    <span class="lag-tag soft-tag">{{ t('~options direction soft', '~期权方向软性') }}</span>
  </div>
  <p class="muted sm note">{{ t(
    "Washout-to-continuation leaders board — volume durability · RVOL vs time-of-day · VWAP context · ~net call premium tape activity &amp; options-flow persistence. All metrics deterministic; no scores; annotates only. Reference levels are not trade advice.",
    "洗盘-延续型领涨股看板 — 成交量持续性 · RVOL与时段基准对比 · VWAP上下 · ~净看涨权利金资金活跃度与期权流动性持续性。所有指标均为确定性计算；无评分；仅作参考标注。参考价位不构成交易建议。") }}</p>
