<!-- Playbook accordion -->
<div class="panel">
  <h2>{{ t('Playbook — Washout to Continuation', '操盘手册 — 洗盘至延续') }}
    <span class="lag-tag">{{ t('field guide', '实战指南') }}</span>
  </h2>

  <div class="playbook-section open">
    <div class="playbook-hd">
      <span>{{ t('1 · Universe &amp; leadership screen', '1 · 覆盖范围与领涨筛选') }}</span>
      <span class="caret">▸</span>
    </div>
    <div class="playbook-body">
      <p class="l-en">This board covers the Mag7, AI infrastructure, AI software, AI semiconductor, semicap equipment, reshoring, defense, and power-grid baskets — names with demonstrated institutional sponsorship and options liquidity. The goal is not to find cheap stocks; it is to find tape-active leaders that have absorbed selling and are showing durable re-accumulation. Only the <em>leader quality</em> universe is relevant — trap-prone names (failed-breakout-trap chip) are deprioritized.</p>
      <p class="l-zh">本看板覆盖Mag7、AI基础设施、AI软件、AI半导体、半导体设备、回流制造、国防与电网篮子——这些标的具有机构持续性参与和期权流动性。目标不是寻找廉价股，而是寻找经历卖压洗盘后表现出持续吸筹的活跃领涨股。只关注<em>领涨质量</em>标的——回踩陷阱型标的（trap-prone标签）优先级降低。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="playbook-section">
    <div class="playbook-hd">
      <span>{{ t('2 · Washout context — what makes a setup valid', '2 · 洗盘背景 — 何为有效布局') }}</span>
      <span class="caret">▸</span>
    </div>
    <div class="playbook-body">
      <p class="l-en">A valid washout context requires at least one of: a Bollinger-lower-band reclaim within the past {{ washout_lb }} sessions (L1a), or a 21-day max drawdown ≤ −12% with recovery already begun (L1b). Without prior compression or selling, a high RVOL reading is just noise. The washout gives the continuation move its structural floor — the stop goes <em>below</em> the washout structure, not below the current bar.</p>
      <p class="l-zh">有效的洗盘背景要求满足至少一项：过去{{ washout_lb }}个交易日内收复布林下轨（L1a），或21日最大回撤≤−12%且已开始修复（L1b）。没有前期压缩或卖压，高RVOL读数只是噪声。洗盘为延续走势提供了结构性底部——止损应设在<em>洗盘结构下方</em>，而非当前K线下方。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="playbook-section">
    <div class="playbook-hd">
      <span>{{ t('3 · Volume &amp; RVOL — durable accumulation vs noise', '3 · 成交量与RVOL — 持续吸筹vs噪声') }}</span>
      <span class="caret">▸</span>
    </div>
    <div class="playbook-body">
      <p class="l-en">RVOL_tod compares today's cumulative volume to ADV20 × the expected time-of-day volume share from trailing 20 sessions. A reading ≥ {{ rvol_confirm }}× (L3) is elevated. Volume durability (L4) requires ≥ {{ (dur_min * 100)|int }}% of today's hourly bars to close in their upper half with above-baseline volume — this distinguishes a sustained bid from a single spike. Higher-lows count confirms price is not giving back each bar's gain. RVOL alone is insufficient; it must arrive with durability.</p>
      <p class="l-zh">RVOL_tod将今日累计成交量与ADV20×过去20个交易日该时段平均成交占比的乘积对比。读数≥{{ rvol_confirm }}×（L3）为放量。成交量持续性（L4）要求今日≥{{ (dur_min * 100)|int }}%的小时K收盘在上半段且成交量高于时段基准——这区分了持续买盘与单次放量。Higher-lows计数确认价格未在每根K线后回吐涨幅。RVOL单独不够，必须配合持续性。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="playbook-section">
    <div class="playbook-hd">
      <span>{{ t('4 · Options tape — tape activity &amp; flow persistence (~soft)', '4 · 期权带 — 活跃度与流动持续性（~软性）') }}</span>
      <span class="caret">▸</span>
    </div>
    <div class="playbook-body">
      <p class="l-en">The options flow block shows tape activity and options-flow persistence. <em>Direction reads are SOFT</em> — ~net call premium (NCP) is signed by minute tick-rule, not NBBO, so the call/put direction is approximate. Flow durability = share of 5-min windows with NCP &gt; 0 + the longest positive streak. This is a confluence input, not a standalone signal, and is not used as an entry trigger in isolation. The bias badge counts (WHALE, FRESH, Z_OUTLIER, etc.) are deterministic; 0DTE is bucket-labeled only, never highlighted.</p>
      <p class="l-zh">期权资金块展示期权活跃度与流动持续性。<em>方向读数为软性近似</em>——~净看涨权利金（NCP）通过逐分钟打单规则定向，非NBBO，因此看涨/看跌方向为近似值。流动持续性=NCP&gt;0的5分钟窗口占比+最长正向连续条数。这是汇聚输入，非独立信号，不单独用于入场触发。偏好标签计数（WHALE、FRESH、Z_OUTLIER等）为确定性计算；0DTE仅做桶分类标注，不特别强调。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="playbook-section">
    <div class="playbook-hd">
      <span>{{ t('5 · Confluence K/7 &amp; entry timing', '5 · 汇聚K/7与入场时机') }}</span>
      <span class="caret">▸</span>
    </div>
    <div class="playbook-body">
      <p class="l-en">K is a simple count of 7 independent boolean legs — no weighting, no score. Higher K means more conditions align simultaneously; it does not imply outcome probability. Useful timing: K rises intraday as more legs activate. The ideal sequence is L1 (washout context) + L6 (mtf_upturn) already set from nightly, then L3+L4 (volume) and L2 (reclaim above VWAP &amp; prevClose) confirm intraday, optionally with L5 (~flow bid). Let the runners run — do not tighten stops into natural retracements on a durable leader.</p>
      <p class="l-zh">K是7个独立布尔腿的简单计数——无加权、无评分。K值越高表示更多条件同时满足；不代表结果概率。实用时机：K值在盘中随更多腿激活而上升。理想顺序：L1（洗盘背景）+L6（多周期上行器官）已由夜间确认，然后L3+L4（成交量）和L2（收复VWAP及前收）盘中确认，可选配L5（~资金偏多）。让盈利跑——不要在持续领涨股的正常回踩中收紧止损。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="playbook-section">
    <div class="playbook-hd">
      <span>{{ t('6 · Reference levels &amp; trap-prone names', '6 · 参考价位与回踩陷阱型标的') }}</span>
      <span class="caret">▸</span>
    </div>
    <div class="playbook-body">
      <p class="l-en">Reference levels (stop, VWAP, session low + ATR%) are computed from nightly entry_signal and intraday fastpath data — <em>they are reference only, not advice</em>. Stop comes from nightly structure; revisit it if the setup changes materially intraday. Trap-prone names (failed_breakout_trap = true) show a red <strong>trap-prone 回踩陷阱</strong> chip and are deprioritized — these names have a track record of faking breakouts and retesting lows repeatedly. Use them only if the full K/7 is elevated AND washout is recent and deep.</p>
      <p class="l-zh">参考价位（止损、VWAP、日内低点+ATR%）由夜间entry_signal和盘中快速路径数据计算——<em>仅供参考，不构成交易建议</em>。止损来自夜间结构；若盘中布局出现重大变化应重新评估。回踩陷阱型标的（failed_breakout_trap=true）显示红色<strong>trap-prone 回踩陷阱</strong>标签并降低优先级——这些标的有反复假突破、一再测试低点的历史。只有在K/7完全满足且洗盘近期且幅度深时才考虑。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="xs muted" style="margin-top:10px">
    {{ t('~NCP direction is SOFT — approximate (minute tick-rule signing, not NBBO). All metrics deterministic; no LLM. Reference levels are not trade advice. Display-tier only.',
         '~NCP方向为软性近似（逐分钟打单，非NBBO）。所有指标均为确定性计算；无LLM参与。参考价位不构成交易建议。仅展示层。') }}
  </p>
</div>

<!-- Inline JS — data loads, polling, table render -->
<script>
(function(){
'use strict';

// ── Config injected from nightly build ────────────────────────────────────
var BASE_DATA = {{ intraday_flow | tojson if intraday_flow else '{}' }};
var RVOL_CONFIRM = BASE_DATA.rvol_confirm || 1.30;
var DUR_MIN = BASE_DATA.durability_min || 0.60;
var WASHOUT_LB = BASE_DATA.washout_lookback || 10;
var LEADERS_BY_TK = {};    // ticker -> leader record (nightly base)
var leaders = BASE_DATA.leaders || [];

// ── Global live state ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
var quoteState = {};        // ticker -> {price, changePct, prevClose, day_volume, day_high, day_low}
var pulseState = {};        // ticker -> {vwap, vol_durability, higher_lows, cum_vol}
var flowState = {};         // ticker -> {ncp, flow_dur, vel_arrow, badges, session_tier}
var flowMeta = {};          // {asof, mode}

// ── Sorting state ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
var sortCol = 'rvol', sortDir = -1;  // default: RVOL desc

// ── Filter state ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
var activeBasket = 'all';
var kMin = 0;
var searchQ = '';

// ── Build ticker index ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
leaders.forEach(function(l){ LEADERS_BY_TK[l.ticker] = l; });

// ── URL helpers ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
function snapUrl() {
  // Mirror live.js: use LIVE_SNAPSHOT_URL (window.LIVE_SNAPSHOT_URL = 'live/quotes.json')
  return window.LIVE_SNAPSHOT_URL || 'live/quotes.json';
}
function pulseUrl() { return 'live/flow_pulse.json'; }
function r2Url(path) {
  var base = (window.DATA_BASE || '').replace(/\/+$/, '');
  if (!base) return null;
  return base + '/' + path;
}

// ── Confluence legs computation ────────────────────────────────────────────
function computeLegs(leader, quote, pulse, flow) {
  var ticker = leader.ticker;

  // L1: washout_recent — from nightly base (bb_lower_reclaim or drawdown field)
  // The nightly base currently doesn't carry bb_lower_reclaim days-ago directly,
  // but entry_signal.status carries context; use vol_squeeze coiled as proxy for now.
  // A richer L1 will accrue as intraday_flow/ledger builds.
  var L1 = false;
  if (leader.entry_signal && leader.entry_signal.status) {
    var st = (leader.entry_signal.status || '').toLowerCase();
    L1 = st.indexOf('washout') >= 0 || st.indexOf('reclaim') >= 0 ||
         st.indexOf('bounce') >= 0 || st.indexOf('buy') >= 0;
  }
  if (leader.vol_squeeze && leader.vol_squeeze.coiled) L1 = true;

  // L2: reclaim — price > VWAP AND price > prevClose
  var L2 = false;
  if (quote && quote.price && pulse && pulse.vwap) {
    L2 = quote.price > pulse.vwap && quote.price > (leader.prev_close || 0);
  }

  // L3: rvol_elevated
  var rvol = computeRvol(leader, quote);
  var L3 = rvol !== null && rvol >= RVOL_CONFIRM;

  // L4: vol_durable
  var volDur = pulse ? (pulse.vol_durability != null ? pulse.vol_durability : null) : null;
  var L4 = volDur !== null && volDur >= DUR_MIN;

  // L5: flow_bid (~soft) — cum NCP > 0 AND flow durability >= DUR_MIN
  var L5 = false;
  if (flow) {
    var ncpPos = flow.ncp != null && flow.ncp > 0;
    var flowDurOk = flow.flow_dur != null && flow.flow_dur >= DUR_MIN;
    L5 = ncpPos && flowDurOk;
  }

  // L6: upturn_organ — mtf_upturn K from nightly base
  var L6 = false;
  if (leader.mtf_upturn_K != null) {
    L6 = leader.mtf_upturn_K >= 3;  // UPTURN_WATCH threshold from mtf_upturn
  } else if (leader.mtf_upturn_state) {
    var mst = (leader.mtf_upturn_state || '').toUpperCase();
    L6 = mst === 'UPTURN_WATCH' || mst === 'UPTURN_CONFIRMED' || mst === 'UPTURN_MOMENTUM';
  }

  // L7: leader_quality — NOT failed_breakout_trap
  var L7 = leader.failed_breakout_trap !== true;

  var legs = [L1, L2, L3, L4, L5, L6, L7];
  var K = legs.filter(Boolean).length;
  return { legs: legs, K: K };
}

// ── RVOL computation ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
function computeRvol(leader, quote) {
  if (!quote || !quote.day_volume || !leader.adv20_shares) return null;
  var curve = leader.vol_share_curve;
  if (!curve || !curve.length) return null;

  // Estimate time-of-day fraction: use hour index = proportional position in curve
  var now = new Date();
  var etOff = -5 * 60;  // ET is UTC-5 (approx; ignores DST)
  var mkt_open = 9 * 60 + 30;  // 9:30 ET in minutes
  var mkt_close = 16 * 60;
  var tzOff = now.getTimezoneOffset();
  var localMins = now.getHours() * 60 + now.getMinutes();
  // Convert local to ET approx
  var etMins = localMins + tzOff + etOff;
  var elapsed = etMins - mkt_open;
  if (elapsed < 0) elapsed = 0;
  var total = mkt_close - mkt_open;
  var frac = Math.min(elapsed / total, 1.0);

  // Cumulative vol share up to this point in the curve
  var n = curve.length;
  var cumIdx = Math.min(Math.floor(frac * n), n - 1);
  var cumShare = 0;
  for (var i = 0; i <= cumIdx; i++) cumShare += (curve[i] || 0);

  if (cumShare <= 0) return null;
  return quote.day_volume / (leader.adv20_shares * cumShare);
}

// ── Day range position computation ────────────────────────────────────────
function computeRangePos(quote) {
  if (!quote) return null;
  var lo = quote.day_low, hi = quote.day_high, px = quote.price;
  if (lo == null || hi == null || px == null) return null;
  var rng = hi - lo;
  if (rng <= 0) return null;
  return (px - lo) / rng;
}

// ── VWAP delta computation ────────────────────────────────────────────────
function computeVwapDelta(quote, pulse) {
  if (!quote || !quote.price || !pulse || !pulse.vwap) return null;
  return (quote.price - pulse.vwap) / pulse.vwap * 100;
}

// ── Format helpers ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
function fmtNum(v, dec) {
  if (v == null || isNaN(v)) return '—';
  return Number(v).toFixed(dec != null ? dec : 2);
}
function fmtPct(v) {
  if (v == null || isNaN(v)) return '—';
  return (v >= 0 ? '+' : '') + Number(v).toFixed(2) + '%';
}
function fmtDollar(v) {
  if (v == null || isNaN(v)) return '—';
  return '$' + Number(v).toFixed(2);
}
function fmtK(n, suffix) {
  if (n == null) return '—';
  n = Number(n);
  if (Math.abs(n) >= 1e6) return (n/1e6).toFixed(1) + 'M' + (suffix||'');
  if (Math.abs(n) >= 1e3) return (n/1e3).toFixed(1) + 'K' + (suffix||'');
  return n.toFixed(0) + (suffix||'');
}
function posNeg(v, threshold) {
  threshold = threshold || 0;
  if (v == null || isNaN(v)) return '';
  return v > threshold ? 'pos' : (v < -threshold ? 'neg' : '');
}
function durColor(v, min) {
  if (v == null) return 'gauge-lo';
  return v >= min ? 'gauge-hi' : (v >= min * 0.7 ? 'gauge-med' : 'gauge-lo');
}

// ── Build a row ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
function buildRow(leader) {
  var tk = leader.ticker;
  var quote = quoteState[tk] || null;
  var pulse = pulseState[tk] || null;
  var flow = flowState[tk] || null;
  var rvol = computeRvol(leader, quote);
  var rangePos = computeRangePos(quote);
  var vwapDelta = computeVwapDelta(quote, pulse);
  var conf = computeLegs(leader, quote, pulse, flow);
  var K = conf.K, legs = conf.legs;
  var entry = leader.entry_signal || {};
  var opt = leader.options_entry || {};

  // Ticker cell
  var tkCell = '<td><a class="tk-link" href="stock.html#'+tk+'">'+tk+'</a></td>';

  // Price cell
  var px = quote && quote.price != null ? fmtDollar(quote.price) : '—';
  var chg = quote && quote.changePct != null ? fmtPct(quote.changePct) : '';
  var chgCls = quote && quote.changePct != null ? posNeg(quote.changePct) : '';
  var priceCell = '<td class="price-cell tabnum"><span class="nb-px" data-sym="'+tk+'" data-mkt="us">'+px+'</span><span class="pct-chg '+chgCls+'">'+chg+'</span></td>';

  // RVOL cell
  var rvolPct = rvol != null ? Math.min(rvol / 3, 1) * 100 : 0;
  var rvolCls = rvol != null && rvol >= RVOL_CONFIRM ? 'gauge-hi' : (rvol != null && rvol >= 0.8 ? 'gauge-med' : 'gauge-lo');
  var rvolStr = rvol != null ? fmtNum(rvol, 2)+'×' : '—';
  var rvolCell = '<td><div class="gauge-wrap">'
    + '<div class="gauge-bar"><div class="gauge-fill '+rvolCls+'" style="width:'+rvolPct.toFixed(1)+'%"></div></div>'
    + '<span class="gauge-val">' + rvolStr + '</span>'
    + '</div></td>';

  // Day range cell
  var rpStr = rangePos != null ? (rangePos * 100).toFixed(0) + '%' : '—';
  var rpCls = rangePos != null ? (rangePos > 0.65 ? 'pos' : (rangePos < 0.35 ? 'neg' : '')) : '';
  var rangeCell = '<td class="tabnum '+rpCls+'">'+rpStr+'</td>';

  // VWAP delta cell
  var vdStr = vwapDelta != null ? fmtPct(vwapDelta) : '—';
  var vdCls = posNeg(vwapDelta);
  var vwapCell = '<td class="tabnum '+vdCls+'">'+vdStr+'</td>';

  // Vol durability cell
  var volDur = pulse ? pulse.vol_durability : null;
  var durPct = volDur != null ? Math.min(volDur, 1) * 100 : 0;
  var durCls = durColor(volDur, DUR_MIN);
  var durStr = volDur != null ? (volDur * 100).toFixed(0) + '%' : '—';
  var hlStr = pulse && pulse.higher_lows != null ? ' HL:' + pulse.higher_lows : '';
  var volDurCell = '<td>'
    + '<div class="gauge-wrap">'
    + '<div class="dur-bar"><div class="dur-fill '+durCls+'" style="width:'+durPct.toFixed(1)+'%"></div></div>'
    + '<span class="gauge-val">'+durStr+'</span>'
    + '</div>'
    + (hlStr ? '<div class="xs muted">'+hlStr+'</div>' : '')
    + '</td>';

  // NCP / flow cell (~soft)
  var ncpVal = flow && flow.ncp != null ? flow.ncp : null;
  var ncpStr = ncpVal != null ? (ncpVal >= 0 ? '+' : '') + fmtK(ncpVal, '') : '—';
  var ncpCls = ncpVal != null ? posNeg(ncpVal) : '';
  var flowDur = flow && flow.flow_dur != null ? flow.flow_dur : null;
  var velArrow = flow ? (flow.vel_arrow || 'flat') : 'flat';
  var arrowHtml = velArrow === 'up' ? '<span class="arrow arrow-up">↑</span>'
    : (velArrow === 'down' ? '<span class="arrow arrow-dn">↓</span>'
    : '<span class="arrow arrow-flat">→</span>');
  var flowDurStr = flowDur != null ? (flowDur * 100).toFixed(0) + '%' : '—';
  var flowDurCls = durColor(flowDur, DUR_MIN);
  var ncpBadge = flow && flow.session_tier ? '<span class="badge badge-blue" style="margin-left:4px">'+flow.session_tier+'</span>' : '';
  var ncpCell = '<td class="flow-ncp">'
    + '<span class="'+ncpCls+'">~'+ncpStr+'</span>'
    + arrowHtml
    + '<span class="soft-tag">~soft</span>'
    + '<br><div class="gauge-wrap" style="margin-top:2px">'
    + '<div class="dur-bar"><div class="dur-fill '+flowDurCls+'" style="width:'+((flowDur||0)*100).toFixed(1)+'%"></div></div>'
    + '<span class="gauge-val">'+flowDurStr+'</span>'
    + '</div>'
    + ncpBadge
    + '</td>';

  // Setup chips
  var chips = [];
  var squeeze = leader.vol_squeeze || {};
  if (squeeze.coiled) chips.push('<span class="badge badge-orange">squeeze</span>');
  if (squeeze.state === 'EXPANSION') chips.push('<span class="badge badge-green">squeeze→expand</span>');
  if (leader.stair_step_leader === true) chips.push('<span class="badge badge-green"><span class="l-en">clean leader</span><span class="l-zh">稳步领涨</span></span>');
  if (leader.failed_breakout_trap === true) chips.push('<span class="badge badge-red"><span class="l-en">trap-prone 回踩陷阱</span><span class="l-zh">回踩陷阱</span></span>');
  if (leader.current_mode) chips.push('<span class="badge badge-muted">'+leader.current_mode+'</span>');
  if (leader.mtf_upturn_state) chips.push('<span class="badge badge-blue">'+leader.mtf_upturn_state+'</span>');
  var flowBadges = flow && flow.badges ? flow.badges : [];
  flowBadges.slice(0, 3).forEach(function(b){
    chips.push('<span class="badge badge-blue">'+b+'</span>');
  });
  if (opt.gamma_regime) {
    var grc = opt.gamma_regime === 'long' ? 'badge-green' : (opt.gamma_regime === 'short' ? 'badge-red' : 'badge-muted');
    chips.push('<span class="badge '+grc+'">GEX:'+opt.gamma_regime+'</span>');
  }
  var setupCell = '<td><div class="chip-row">'+chips.join('')+'</div></td>';

  // K/7 cell with expandable legs
  var legNames = ['L1 washout','L2 reclaim','L3 rvol','L4 vol dur','L5 ~flow bid','L6 upturn','L7 quality'];
  var legNamesZh = ['L1 洗盘','L2 收复','L3 RVOL','L4 量持续','L5 ~资金偏多','L6 上升','L7 质量'];
  var kColor = K >= 5 ? 'pos' : (K >= 3 ? '' : 'muted');
  var dotsHtml = '<div class="kbar">' + legs.map(function(on){
    return '<div class="kbar-dot '+(on?'on':'')+'"></div>';
  }).join('') + '</div>';
  var legHtmlEn = legs.map(function(on, i){
    return '<span class="leg-chip '+(on?'leg-on':'leg-off')+'" title="'+legNames[i]+'">'
      +(on?'✓':'✗')+' '+legNames[i]+'</span>';
  }).join('');
  var legHtmlZh = legs.map(function(on, i){
    return '<span class="leg-chip '+(on?'leg-on':'leg-off')+'" title="'+legNamesZh[i]+'">'
      +(on?'✓':'✗')+' '+legNamesZh[i]+'</span>';
  }).join('');
  var kCell = '<td><span class="k-label '+kColor+'">'+K+'/7</span>'
    + dotsHtml
    + '<button class="k-expand-btn" onclick="toggleLegs(this)" title="Expand legs">+</button>'
    + '<div class="k-legs-row"><span class="l-en">'+legHtmlEn+'</span><span class="l-zh">'+legHtmlZh+'</span></div>'
    + '</td>';

  // Risk ladder cell
  var stopPx = entry.stop != null ? fmtDollar(entry.stop) : null;
  var vwapPx = pulse && pulse.vwap != null ? fmtDollar(pulse.vwap) : null;
  var loPx = quote && quote.day_low != null ? fmtDollar(quote.day_low) : null;
  var atrPct = entry.atr_pct != null ? entry.atr_pct.toFixed(2) + '%' : (leader.atr14_pct != null ? (leader.atr14_pct * 100).toFixed(2) + '%' : null);
  var riskParts = [];
  if (stopPx) riskParts.push('<span class="level"><span class="l-en">stop</span><span class="l-zh">止损</span>: <span class="neg">'+stopPx+'</span></span>');
  if (vwapPx) riskParts.push('<span class="level">VWAP: '+vwapPx+'</span>');
  if (loPx) riskParts.push('<span class="level"><span class="l-en">low</span><span class="l-zh">低点</span>: '+loPx+'</span>');
  if (atrPct) riskParts.push('<span class="level">ATR: '+atrPct+'</span>');
  var riskCell = '<td class="risk-mini">'
    + (riskParts.length ? riskParts.join('') : '<span class="muted">—</span>')
    + '</td>';

  return '<tr data-ticker="'+tk+'" data-rvol="'+(rvol||0)+'" data-k="'+K+'"'
    + ' data-last="'+(quote && quote.price||0)+'" data-range-pos="'+(rangePos||0)+'"'
    + ' data-vwap-delta="'+(vwapDelta||0)+'" data-vol-dur="'+(pulse && pulse.vol_durability||0)+'"'
    + ' data-ncp="'+(ncpVal||0)+'" data-baskets="'+getBaskets(tk)+'">'
    + tkCell + priceCell + rvolCell + rangeCell + vwapCell + volDurCell + ncpCell + setupCell + kCell + riskCell
    + '</tr>';
}

// ── Basket lookup ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
var tkBasketMap = {};
(function(){
  // Per-ticker basket membership is written by the nightly builder into each
  // leader record's "baskets" field.
  leaders.forEach(function(l){
    tkBasketMap[l.ticker] = (l.baskets || []).join(' ') || 'all';
  });
})();

function getBaskets(tk) {
  return tkBasketMap[tk] || 'all';
}

// ── Sort helpers ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
var COL_ATTR = {
  ticker: 'data-ticker', last: 'data-last', rvol: 'data-rvol',
  range_pos: 'data-range-pos', vwap_delta: 'data-vwap-delta',
  vol_dur: 'data-vol-dur', ncp: 'data-ncp', k: 'data-k'
};

function sortTable() {
  var tbody = document.getElementById('leaders-body');
  if (!tbody) return;
  var rows = [].slice.call(tbody.querySelectorAll('tr[data-ticker]'));
  var attr = COL_ATTR[sortCol] || 'data-rvol';
  rows.sort(function(a, b) {
    var av = a.getAttribute(attr) || '0';
    var bv = b.getAttribute(attr) || '0';
    var aNum = isNaN(av) ? av : Number(av);
    var bNum = isNaN(bv) ? bv : Number(bv);
    if (aNum < bNum) return sortDir;
    if (aNum > bNum) return -sortDir;
    return 0;
  });
  rows.forEach(function(r){ tbody.appendChild(r); });
  // Update sort indicators
  var ths = document.querySelectorAll('table.leaders th[data-col]');
  ths.forEach(function(th){
    th.classList.remove('sort-asc', 'sort-desc');
    if (th.getAttribute('data-col') === sortCol) {
      th.classList.add(sortDir < 0 ? 'sort-desc' : 'sort-asc');
    }
  });
  document.getElementById('sort-label').textContent = 'Sorted by ' + sortCol + (sortDir < 0 ? ' ↓' : ' ↑');
}

// ── Filter / search ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
function applyFilter() {
  var tbody = document.getElementById('leaders-body');
  if (!tbody) return;
  var rows = [].slice.call(tbody.querySelectorAll('tr[data-ticker]'));
  var visible = 0;
  rows.forEach(function(r){
    var tk = r.getAttribute('data-ticker') || '';
    var k = Number(r.getAttribute('data-k') || 0);
    var baskets = r.getAttribute('data-baskets') || 'all';
    var show = true;
    if (activeBasket !== 'all' && baskets.indexOf(activeBasket) < 0 && baskets !== 'all') show = false;
    if (kMin > 0 && k < kMin) show = false;
    if (searchQ && tk.indexOf(searchQ.toUpperCase()) < 0) show = false;
    r.style.display = show ? '' : 'none';
    if (show) visible++;
  });
  var lbl = document.getElementById('count-label');
  if (lbl) lbl.textContent = visible + ' shown of ' + rows.length + ' leaders';
}

// ── Full table render ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
function renderTable() {
  var tbody = document.getElementById('leaders-body');
  if (!tbody) return;
  var html = '';
  leaders.forEach(function(l){ html += buildRow(l); });
  tbody.innerHTML = html || '<tr class="loading-row"><td colspan="10"><span class="l-en">No data loaded yet</span><span class="l-zh">暂无数据</span></td></tr>';
  sortTable();
  applyFilter();
  // Re-run lang sync (hidden spans)
  if (window.__mmLang) window.__mmLang();
}

// ── Partial update — patch price/gauge cells without full re-render ────────
function patchPriceCells() {
  var tbody = document.getElementById('leaders-body');
  if (!tbody) return;
  var rows = tbody.querySelectorAll('tr[data-ticker]');
  rows.forEach(function(tr){
    var tk = tr.getAttribute('data-ticker');
    var leader = LEADERS_BY_TK[tk];
    if (!leader) return;
    var quote = quoteState[tk];
    var pulse = pulseState[tk];
    var flow = flowState[tk];
    // Price
    var pxEl = tr.querySelector('.nb-px[data-sym]');
    if (pxEl && quote && quote.price != null) pxEl.textContent = '$' + Number(quote.price).toFixed(2);
    var chgEl = tr.querySelector('.pct-chg');
    if (chgEl && quote && quote.changePct != null) {
      var chg = Number(quote.changePct);
      chgEl.textContent = (chg >= 0 ? '+' : '') + chg.toFixed(2) + '%';
      chgEl.className = 'pct-chg ' + (chg >= 0 ? 'pos' : 'neg');
    }
    // Update row data-attrs for sorting
    if (quote) {
      if (quote.price != null) tr.setAttribute('data-last', quote.price);
      var rvol = computeRvol(leader, quote);
      if (rvol != null) tr.setAttribute('data-rvol', rvol);
      var rp = computeRangePos(quote);
      if (rp != null) tr.setAttribute('data-range-pos', rp);
    }
    if (pulse) {
      var vd = computeVwapDelta(quote, pulse);
      if (vd != null) tr.setAttribute('data-vwap-delta', vd);
      if (pulse.vol_durability != null) tr.setAttribute('data-vol-dur', pulse.vol_durability);
    }
    if (flow) {
      if (flow.ncp != null) tr.setAttribute('data-ncp', flow.ncp);
    }
    // K
    var conf = computeLegs(leader, quote, pulse, flow);
    tr.setAttribute('data-k', conf.K);
  });
  sortTable();
  applyFilter();
}

// ── Quotes fetch ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
var quotesInflight = false;
function fetchQuotes() {
  if (quotesInflight) return;
  quotesInflight = true;
  var url = snapUrl();
  fetch(url, {cache: 'no-cache'}).then(function(r){ return r.json(); })
    .then(function(data){
      quotesInflight = false;
      var q = data.quotes || {};
      Object.keys(q).forEach(function(tk){ quoteState[tk] = q[tk]; });
      var stamp = document.getElementById('ift-quotes-stamp');
      if (stamp) {
        var asof = data.asof || data.ts;
        var delayMin = (data.meta && data.meta.delayed_min) || 15;
        stamp.innerHTML = '<span class="l-en">as of '+(asof||'?')+' · '+delayMin+'-min delayed bars</span>'
          + '<span class="l-zh">截至 '+(asof||'?')+' · '+delayMin+'分钟延迟</span>';
      }
      patchPriceCells();
    }).catch(function(e){
      quotesInflight = false;
    });
}

// ── Flow pulse fetch ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
var pulseInflight = false;
function fetchPulse() {
  if (pulseInflight) return;
  pulseInflight = true;
  fetch(pulseUrl(), {cache: 'no-cache'}).then(function(r){ return r.json(); })
    .then(function(data){
      pulseInflight = false;
      var tickers = data.tickers || [];
      tickers.forEach(function(t){ pulseState[t.ticker] = t; });
      var stamp = document.getElementById('ift-pulse-stamp');
      if (stamp) {
        var asof = data.as_of || '?';
        var stale = data.stale ? ' · stale' : '';
        stamp.innerHTML = '<span class="l-en">as of '+asof+stale+'</span>'
          + '<span class="l-zh">截至 '+asof+stale+'</span>';
      }
      patchPriceCells();
    }).catch(function(e){
      pulseInflight = false;
    });
}

// ── R2 live flow fetch ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
var flowInflight = false;
function fetchFlow() {
  if (flowInflight) return;
  var enrichUrl = r2Url('live_flow/enrich_current.json');
  var tickerUrl = r2Url('live_flow/tide_current.json');
  if (!enrichUrl) return;

  flowInflight = true;
  // Fetch enrich_current for per-ticker badges + session tier
  Promise.all([
    fetch(enrichUrl, {cache: 'no-cache'}).then(function(r){ return r.json(); }).catch(function(){ return null; }),
    tickerUrl ? fetch(tickerUrl, {cache: 'no-cache'}).then(function(r){ return r.json(); }).catch(function(){ return null; }) : Promise.resolve(null)
  ]).then(function(results){
    flowInflight = false;
    var enrich = results[0];
    var tide = results[1];

    // Parse enrich: schema live_flow.enrich/v1 — per-ticker enriched events
    if (enrich && enrich.tickers) {
      Object.keys(enrich.tickers).forEach(function(root){
        var te = enrich.tickers[root] || {};
        var badges = [];
        if (te.badge_counts) {
          var bc = te.badge_counts;
          ['WHALE','FRESH','Z_OUTLIER','SIZE_VS_OI','REPEAT_HITTER'].forEach(function(b){
            if (bc[b] && bc[b] > 0) badges.push(b + '×' + bc[b]);
          });
        }
        var existing = flowState[root] || {};
        flowState[root] = Object.assign(existing, {
          badges: badges,
          session_tier: te.session_tier || null
        });
      });
    }
    // Try per-ticker NCP from tide
    if (tide && tide.tickers) {
      Object.keys(tide.tickers).forEach(function(root){
        var te = tide.tickers[root] || {};
        var existing = flowState[root] || {};
        flowState[root] = Object.assign(existing, {
          ncp: te.cum_ncp != null ? te.cum_ncp : (existing.ncp || null),
          flow_dur: te.flow_dur != null ? te.flow_dur : (existing.flow_dur || null),
          vel_arrow: te.vel_arrow || existing.vel_arrow || 'flat'
        });
      });
    }

    // Determine asof from meta
    var asof = (enrich && enrich.meta && enrich.meta.asof) || (tide && tide.meta && tide.meta.asof) || null;
    var isRTH = isMarketHours();
    var stamp = document.getElementById('ift-flow-stamp');
    if (stamp) {
      if (!isRTH) {
        stamp.innerHTML = '<span class="l-en">off-hours · last: '+(asof||'—')+'</span>'
          + '<span class="l-zh">非交易时段 · 最后: '+(asof||'—')+'</span>';
      } else {
        stamp.innerHTML = '<span class="l-en">as of '+(asof||'?')+'</span>'
          + '<span class="l-zh">截至 '+(asof||'?')+'</span>';
      }
    }

    patchPriceCells();
  }).catch(function(){
    flowInflight = false;
  });
}

function isMarketHours() {
  var now = new Date();
  var utcH = now.getUTCHours(), utcM = now.getUTCMinutes();
  var etH = utcH - 5;  // approx ET (no DST correction)
  if (etH < 0) etH += 24;
  var etMins = etH * 60 + utcM;
  // 9:25 - 16:05 ET
  return etMins >= (9 * 60 + 25) && etMins <= (16 * 60 + 5);
}

// ── Playbook accordion ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
document.querySelectorAll('.playbook-hd').forEach(function(hd){
  hd.addEventListener('click', function(){
    var sec = hd.parentElement;
    sec.classList.toggle('open');
  });
});

// ── Sort click ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
document.querySelectorAll('table.leaders th[data-col]').forEach(function(th){
  th.addEventListener('click', function(){
    var col = th.getAttribute('data-col');
    if (col === sortCol) { sortDir = -sortDir; }
    else { sortCol = col; sortDir = -1; }
    sortTable();
  });
});

// ── Basket filter chips ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
document.querySelectorAll('.chip[data-basket]').forEach(function(chip){
  chip.addEventListener('click', function(){
    document.querySelectorAll('.chip[data-basket]').forEach(function(c){ c.classList.remove('active'); });
    chip.classList.add('active');
    activeBasket = chip.getAttribute('data-basket');
    applyFilter();
  });
});

// ── K filter ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
var kSel = document.getElementById('k-sel');
if (kSel) kSel.addEventListener('change', function(){
  kMin = Number(kSel.value);
  applyFilter();
});

// ── Search ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
var searchEl = document.getElementById('ift-search');
if (searchEl) searchEl.addEventListener('input', function(){
  searchQ = searchEl.value.trim();
  applyFilter();
});

// ── Leg expand/collapse ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
window.toggleLegs = function(btn) {
  var row = btn.parentElement.querySelector('.k-legs-row');
  if (!row) return;
  row.classList.toggle('open');
  btn.textContent = row.classList.contains('open') ? '−' : '+';
};

// ── Polling timers ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
function startPolling() {
  fetchQuotes();
  fetchPulse();
  fetchFlow();
  setInterval(fetchQuotes, 60 * 1000);   // every 60s
  setInterval(fetchPulse, 5 * 60 * 1000); // every 5 min
  // Flow: every 3 min during RTH only
  setInterval(function(){
    if (isMarketHours()) fetchFlow();
  }, 3 * 60 * 1000);
}

// ── Init ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
renderTable();
if (typeof window !== 'undefined') {
  if (document.readyState === 'loading') {
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', startPolling);
  } else {
    startPolling();
  }
}

})();
</script>
<script src="theme.js"></script>
</body>
